{"kind":"assert","text":"RESUMED by Hugh, 9 November 2026. The pause in 40e0d646 ends.\n\nThe request text dates from 19 October and says there is no deployed history to keep. That is no longer true. dap-grow, dap-lending, dap-demo and artroom-scope hold rooms with recorded journals, and this change rewrites references and entries.\n\nBefore any source edit, report on this request:\n1. What current main already covers and what has moved since 2fcd50ab: today's counts of ScopeRef, FactRef and the incarnation member, and the state of the six places the request names.\n2. What happens to the rooms already deployed, and the cheapest honest choice for each: keep them readable, or retire them with a stated end.\n3. A proposed split into reviewable heads.\n\nThe planner places the build in the order after that report, and takes the deployed-rooms choice to Hugh. Section 8's rule stands: if a rule cannot be built as written, stop and ask."}